{
    "title": "Slice & Dice",
    "description": "Free demo, no ads, single IAP to unlock the full game.\r\n\r\nTake control of 5 heroes, each with their own dice. Fight your way through 20 levels of monsters and try to take on the final boss. If you lose a single fight you have to start over so be careful (and lucky!).\r\n\r\n<b>Gameplay</b>\r\n- 3D dice physics, choose which dice to reroll\r\n- Simple turn-based combat\r\n- Level up a hero or gain an item after each fight\r\n- Randomly-generated encounters\r\n- Undo actions as much as you like, each turn is like a mini-puzzle\r\n- No hidden mechanics, everything is visible at all times\r\n\r\n<b>Features</b>\r\n- 100 hero classes (+20,000??)\r\n- 61 monsters\r\n- 354 items\r\n- 18 extra modes, including infinite curse mode\r\n- 300+ difficulty modifiers\r\n- Lots of achievements\r\n- Ridiculous Combos\r\n- Online leaderboards\r\n- Portrait or Landscape",
    "descriptionHTML": "Free demo, no ads, single IAP to unlock the full game.<br><br>Take control of 5 heroes, each with their own dice. Fight your way through 20 levels of monsters and try to take on the final boss. If you lose a single fight you have to start over so be careful (and lucky!).<br><br><b>Gameplay</b><br>- 3D dice physics, choose which dice to reroll<br>- Simple turn-based combat<br>- Level up a hero or gain an item after each fight<br>- Randomly-generated encounters<br>- Undo actions as much as you like, each turn is like a mini-puzzle<br>- No hidden mechanics, everything is visible at all times<br><br><b>Features</b><br>- 100 hero classes (+20,000??)<br>- 61 monsters<br>- 354 items<br>- 18 extra modes, including infinite curse mode<br>- 300+ difficulty modifiers<br>- Lots of achievements<br>- Ridiculous Combos<br>- Online leaderboards<br>- Portrait or Landscape",
